ull, "archived_by": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 0, "created_at": "2025-01-09T03:05:21Z", "updated_at": "2025-01-14T22:22:54Z", "closed_at": "2025-01-14T20:53:03Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "draft": false, "pull_request": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/pulls/18453", "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/18453", "diff_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/18453.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/18453.patch", "merged_at": "2025-01-14T20:53:03Z"}, "body": "remove follow handler within KafkaApis\r\n- ELECT_LEADERS\r\n- ALTER_PARTITION\r\n- UPDATE_FEATURES\r\n\r\n\r\n### Committer Checklist (excluded from commit message)\r\n- [ ] Verify design and implementation \r\n- [ ] Verify test coverage and CI build status\r\n- [ ] Verify documentation (including upgrade notes)\r\n", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/18453/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/18453/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": null, "score": 1.0}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/18513", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/18513/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/18513/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/18513/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/18513", "id": 2784800315, "node_id": "PR_kwDOACG9q86Hk6Ho", "number": 18513, "title": "KAFKA-18298;KAFKA-18297: Fix flaky testConsumerGroupsDeprecatedConsumerGroupState and testConsumerGroups in PlaintextAdminIntegrationTest", "user": {"login": "chenyulin0719", "id": 26764036, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzY0MDM2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26764036?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/chenyulin0719", "html_url": "https://github.com/chenyulin0719", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chenyulin0719/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chenyulin0719/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chenyulin0719/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chenyulin0719/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chenyulin0719/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chenyulin0719/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chenyulin0719/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chenyulin0719/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chenyulin0719/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 838330122, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4MzgzMzAxMjI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/core", "name": "core", "color": "ed5a86", "default": false, "description": "Kafka Broker", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 1257747426, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWwxMjU3NzQ3NDI2", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/tests", "name": "tests", "color": "cfff60", "default": false, "description": "Test fixes (including flaky tests)", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 4771354362, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABHGUW-g", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/KIP-848", "name": "KIP-848", "color": "0E87F1", "default": false, "description": "The Next Generation of the Consumer Rebalance Protocol", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 11, "created_at": "2025-01-13T17:57:11Z", "updated_at": "2025-02-14T12:38:39Z", "closed_at": "2025-02-13T23:28:45Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "draft": false, "pull_request": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/pulls/18513", "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/18513", "diff_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/18513.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/18513.patch", "merged_at": "2025-02-13T23:28:45Z"}, "body": "It's related to KAFKA-18298 and KAFKA-18297.\r\n\r\nThe root cause of the flaky tests is member rejoin after member removal.\r\n\r\nTo prevent members from rejoining after being removed, before removing group members, calling `consumers.close` in ConsumerThread . This fix also extract the flaky member removal test  to new test `testConsumerGroupWithMemberRemoval`.\r\n\r\nFlow of member removal test: \r\n1. Set 2 static consumer + 1 dynamic consumer\r\n2. Close all consumers.\r\n3. remove one static member\r\n4. remove remaining members\r\n \r\nBefore KIP-1092, the member count is different between ClassicConsumer/AsyncConsumer. (AsyncConsumer will remove dynamic member after consumer closed.)\r\n\r\nTo get more details, please refer to the discussion under KAFKA-18297 and this PR:\r\n- discussion : [Link](https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18297?focusedCommentId=17912537&page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-17912537)\r\n- review: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/18513#pullrequestreview-2589110367\r\n\r\n\r\nThis PR fixed below flaky errors:\r\n1. **PlaintextAdminIntegrationTest#testConsumerGroups**\r\n  a.  `org.opentest4j.AssertionFailedError: expected: <2> but was: <3>` ([Report](https://ge.apache.org/s/lt3lpviv45cns/tests/task/:core:test/details/kafka.api.PlaintextAdminIntegrationTest/testConsumerGroups(String%2C%20String)%5B1%5D?top-execution=1))\r\n  b.  `org.opentest4j.AssertionFailedError: expected: <true> but was: <false>` ([Report](https://ge.apache.org/s/jlxo446xalpoa/tests/task/:core:test/details/kafka.api.PlaintextAdminIntegrationTest/testConsumerGroups(String%2C%20String)%5B1%5D?top-execution=1))\r\n8. **PlaintextAdminIntegrationTest#testConsumerGroupsDeprecatedConsumerGroupState**\r\n  a.  `org.opentest4j.AssertionFailedError: expected: <2> but was: <3>` ([Report](https://ge.apache.org/s/ndoj6s2stb446/tests/task/:core:test/details/kafka.api.PlaintextAdminIntegrationTest/testConsumerGroupsDeprecatedConsumerGroupState(String%2C%20String)%5B1%5D?top-execution=1))\r\n  b. `org.opentest4j.AssertionFailedError: expected: <true> but was: <false>` ([Report](https://ge.apache.org/s/kh3jze2tc5qeu/tests/task/:core:test/details/kafka.api.PlaintextAdminIntegrationTest/testConsumerGroupsDeprecatedConsumerGroupState(String%2C%20String)%5B1%5D?top-execution=1))\r\n\r\nTest command: (No error within 100 loops in my local env)\r\n```\r\nN=100; I=0; while [ $I -lt $N ] && ./gradlew core:test --tests PlaintextAdminIntegrationTest.testConsumerGroupsDeprecatedConsumerGroupState --tests PlaintextAdminIntegrationTest.testConsumerGroups --tests PlaintextAdminIntegrationTest.testConsumerGroupWithMemberRemoval --rerun --fail-fast; do (( I=$I+1 )); echo \"Completed run: $I\"; sleep 1; done\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n**Note**:  The flaky can be reproduced with[ this patch](https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13073949/0001-Reproduce-KAFKA-18298-and-KAFKA-18297-in-ClassicConsumer.patch). (Uncomment the sleep 1 sec)\r\n\r\n**Co-authored-by**: TaiJuWu (tjwu1217@gmail.com)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### Committer Checklist (excluded from commit message)\r\n- [ ] Verify design and implementation \r\n- [ ] Verify test coverage and CI build status\r\n- [ ] Verify documentation (including upgrade notes)\r\n", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/issues/18513/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart"